          <caption>
            <p>Polymorphic Light Eruption. Symmetrically distributed eruption of erythematous papules and coalescing plaques localized to the anterior chest, characteristic of the papular variant of polymorphic light eruption. <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://dermnetnz.org/images">DermNet New Zealand</ext-link></p>
