      <floats-group id="article-34016.s18">
        <fig id="article-34016.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Papular Polymorphic Light Eruption. Symmetric eruption of erythematous papules and plaques on the bilateral lower legs in a woman, a presentation typical of the papular variant of polymorphic light eruption. <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://dermnetnz.org/images">DermNet New Zealand</ext-link></p>
          </caption>
